@startuml sequence_live
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Monthly Progress - Live load + invalidation

actor User
participant "Tile" as T
participant "Controller" as C
participant "API" as API
participant "DB" as DB
participant "Notifier" as N
participant "SignalR" as SR

User -> T: Mount tile (Live mode)
T -> C: load('live', null)
C -> API: GET /monthly-progress
API -> DB: 4 x SELECT COUNT per bucket
DB --> API: counts
API --> C: { buckets: [...] }
C --> T: signal updates
T --> User: 4 bars rendered

== later, activity recorded ==
N -> SR: dashboardTileDataInvalidated [monthlyProgress]
SR --> T: bindTileMode wakes
T -> C: load('live', null)
C -> API: GET /monthly-progress
API --> C: refreshed counts
C --> T: signal updates
T --> User: rightmost bar grows

@enduml
